{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05284","headline":"送张亶赴朔方应制 · 萧至忠","name":"送张亶赴朔方应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"命将择耆年，图功胜必全。\n光辉万乘饯，威武二庭宣。\n中衢横鼓角，旷野蔽旌旃。\n推食天厨至，投醪御酒传。\n凉风过鴈苑，杀气下鸡田。\n分阃恩何极，临岐动睿篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧至忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}